<title>USA: Chem Intl knows not why stock fell Monday.</title>
<headline>Chem Intl knows not why stock fell Monday.</headline>
<dateline>HILLSIDE, N.J. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>- Chem International Inc said Tuesday it knew of no reason that could explain Monday's sharp drop in the company's stock price.</p>
<p>In Nasdaq trade Monday, the shares fell 2-3/4 to 3-1/4, but rebounded 1-1/8 today to close at 4-3/8.</p>
